@startuml
' bt-view-kind: container
' bt-view-id: world-engine:runtime-containers
title World Engine - Runtime Containers
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam wrapWidth 220
skinparam maxMessageSize 180

' bt-element-id: api
' bt-element-id: manager
' bt-element-id: runtime
' bt-element-id: persistence
' bt-element-id: observability

rectangle "Story API\nResponsibility: Expose health, package, session, turn and branching routes\nContract: Validated HTTP/WS envelopes\n[[../../../../world-engine/app/api/http.py source]]" as api
rectangle "Story Runtime Manager\nResponsibility: Coordinate canonical sessions and turns\nContract: Single live authority\n[[../../../../world-engine/app/story_runtime/manager/runtime_manager.py source]]" as manager
rectangle "Compatibility Runtime\nResponsibility: Host legacy engine profiles and transitional behavior\nContract: Explicitly non-canonical where overlapped\n[[../../../../world-engine/app/runtime/manager.py source]]" as runtime
rectangle "Session Stores\nResponsibility: Persist committed session, branches and callbacks\nContract: Commit-versioned state\n[[../../../../world-engine/app/story_runtime/story_session_store.py source]]" as persistence
rectangle "Runtime Observability\nResponsibility: Correlate turn lifecycle and failures\nContract: Redacted trace tree\n[[../../../../world-engine/app/observability/trace.py source]]" as observability

api ..> manager : "delegates story operation\ncontract: validated command\n[[../../../../world-engine/app/api/http_routes/story_turn_routes.py source]]"
manager ..> observability : "emits lifecycle evidence\ncontract: trace-correlated spans\n[[../../../../world-engine/app/observability/trace.py source]]"
manager ..> persistence : "loads and stores session\ncontract: revision-safe transaction\n[[../../../../world-engine/app/story_runtime/story_session_store.py source]]"
runtime ..> manager : "adapts supported legacy paths\ncontract: explicit compatibility seam\n[[../../../../world-engine/app/runtime/manager.py source]]"

legend bottom
Viewpoint: container
Concern: API, canonical manager, compatibility runtime, persistence and observability
Elements expose responsibility, contract and source anchor.
Edges name the interaction or dependency contract.
endlegend
@enduml
